  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "4017201",
      "subQuestName": "Wait until the next day (07:00 – 11:00)",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "401720101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "401720101": {
            "id": "401720101",
            "speakerId": 1096,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "Hey, everyone.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720102"
            ]
          },
          "401720102": {
            "id": "401720102",
            "speakerId": 1094,
            "speakerName": "Ororon",
            "text": "Ah, Granny. You're back.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720103"
            ]
          },
          "401720103": {
            "id": "401720103",
            "speakerId": 1096,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "So... no good news for me, then?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720104"
            ]
          },
          "401720104": {
            "id": "401720104",
            "speakerId": 1094,
            "speakerName": "Ororon",
            "text": "#You saw right through me. {NICKNAME} collected a lot of spirits, and I checked all of them one by one. None of them matches Leyla's description.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720105"
            ]
          },
          "401720105": {
            "id": "401720105",
            "speakerId": 1096,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "I figured. It was written all over your face. It's alright, I didn't exactly have high hopes for the needle-in-a-haystack approach anyway.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720106"
            ]
          },
          "401720106": {
            "id": "401720106",
            "speakerId": 1094,
            "speakerName": "Ororon",
            "text": "Leyla's condition is still stable, but we're not really getting anywhere.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720107"
            ]
          },
          "401720107": {
            "id": "401720107",
            "speakerId": 1096,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "Well, luckily I made some progress on my end. Leyla's parents told me that he made a new friend recently, and apparently, he's been out of the house for days at a time.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720108"
            ]
          },
          "401720108": {
            "id": "401720108",
            "speakerId": 1096,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "On one occasion, they secretly followed him, and saw him and his friend tinkering around with something at a camp.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720109"
            ]
          },
          "401720109": {
            "id": "401720109",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "They saw his friend?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720110"
            ]
          },
          "401720110": {
            "id": "401720110",
            "speakerId": 1096,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "Yeah, some guy who goes by the name \"Kokuchuu.\" Dressed in what looked like Inazuman attire.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720111"
            ]
          },
          "401720111": {
            "id": "401720111",
            "speakerId": 14603,
            "speakerName": "Leyla",
            "text": "Is this really all I'll need, Mr. Kokuchuu?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720112"
            ]
          },
          "401720112": {
            "id": "401720112",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Kokuchuu",
            "text": "Based on my studies of the ancient texts, hypersensitivity is usually treated with desensitization therapy. So, I figure there's no reason it shouldn't work in reverse.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720113"
            ]
          },
          "401720113": {
            "id": "401720113",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Kokuchuu",
            "text": "Now, for a poor chap like yourself, with no sensitivity to spirits whatsoever, you'll have to completely immerse yourself in spiritually rich substances for this to be effective. I'm electing to name this approach \"hypersensitization therapy\"...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720114"
            ]
          },
          "401720114": {
            "id": "401720114",
            "speakerId": 14603,
            "speakerName": "Leyla",
            "text": "...Is it risky?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720115"
            ]
          },
          "401720115": {
            "id": "401720115",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Kokuchuu",
            "text": "You're the spirit-duffer, not me. I'm sure you're more clued up than I am on the potential consequences of brute-force clairvoyance. Ultimately, it's your decision.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720116"
            ]
          },
          "401720116": {
            "id": "401720116",
            "speakerId": 14603,
            "speakerName": "Leyla",
            "text": "Alright... But I do have one last question... What's in this for you?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720117"
            ]
          },
          "401720117": {
            "id": "401720117",
            "speakerId": 14603,
            "speakerName": "Leyla",
            "text": "People like me obviously don't have much clout in this tribe, so it's not like I can offer you much in return.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720118"
            ]
          },
          "401720118": {
            "id": "401720118",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Kokuchuu",
            "text": "You think I'm looking for a reward? Oh, my good sir! Take a look at my face. Isn't the answer written here, clear as day?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720119"
            ]
          },
          "401720119": {
            "id": "401720119",
            "speakerId": 14603,
            "speakerName": "Leyla",
            "text": "Uh... What? What's written there...?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720120"
            ]
          },
          "401720120": {
            "id": "401720120",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Kokuchuu",
            "text": "\"Just a friendly guy who's happy to help.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720121"
            ]
          },
          "401720121": {
            "id": "401720121",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "What? So... some random guy from Inazuma just felt like helping Leyla cure his... spirit-duffer... ness?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720122"
            ]
          },
          "401720122": {
            "id": "401720122",
            "speakerId": 1094,
            "speakerName": "Ororon",
            "text": "Hypersensitization therapy, huh... What a novel idea. Could that really work?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720123"
            ]
          },
          "401720123": {
            "id": "401720123",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Not on Leyla, by the looks of things.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720124"
            ]
          },
          "401720124": {
            "id": "401720124",
            "speakerId": 1096,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "Hmph, it's anything but novel. Our tribe used to offer it as a treatment once upon a time, but it was so fraught with risks and had such an abysmal success rate that it was eventually outlawed.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720125"
            ]
          },
          "401720125": {
            "id": "401720125",
            "speakerId": 1096,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "As for this Kokuchuu fellow... I'm sure he has his own agenda. He conveniently disappeared right after Leyla got into this mess.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720126"
            ]
          },
          "401720126": {
            "id": "401720126",
            "speakerId": 1096,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "Leyla's parents gave me the address of the camp, so I went and checked it out. There were clear traces of spiritual energy, and also... look what I found.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720127"
            ]
          },
          "401720127": {
            "id": "401720127",
            "speakerId": 1094,
            "speakerName": "Ororon",
            "text": "What's this?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720128"
            ]
          },
          "401720128": {
            "id": "401720128",
            "speakerId": 1096,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "A broken shard... probably from a weapon or some sort of ceremonial implement.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720129"
            ]
          },
          "401720129": {
            "id": "401720129",
            "speakerId": 1096,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "You feel that? It might look old, but it has extremely strong traces of spiritual energy.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720130"
            ]
          },
          "401720130": {
            "id": "401720130",
            "speakerId": 1096,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "Leyla must have used this as his medium. It would definitely explain how a spirit-duffer like him was able to trigger a clairvoyant experience.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720131"
            ]
          },
          "401720131": {
            "id": "401720131",
            "speakerId": 1094,
            "speakerName": "Ororon",
            "text": "Wait, there's something else... It feels so familiar... I think this is somehow connected to my ancient name...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720132"
            ]
          },
          "401720132": {
            "id": "401720132",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Connected how? Is it, like, a shard of an ancient name?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720133"
            ]
          },
          "401720133": {
            "id": "401720133",
            "speakerId": 1094,
            "speakerName": "Ororon",
            "text": "No... More like, I think this item might have belonged to a previous bearer of my ancient name.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720134"
            ]
          },
          "401720134": {
            "id": "401720134",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Perhaps it was Sanhaj?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720135"
            ]
          },
          "401720135": {
            "id": "401720135",
            "speakerId": 1096,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "Okay, that's it, Granny's getting itchy clairvoyance fingers. I'm going to try using this shard as a medium.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720136"
            ]
          },
          "401720136": {
            "id": "401720136",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Cool, same as last time? {NICKNAME} can use the spiritloom to record what you find on a woven scroll.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720137"
            ]
          },
          "401720137": {
            "id": "401720137",
            "speakerId": 1096,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "Nope, Ororon can do the recording this time.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720138"
            ]
          },
          "401720138": {
            "id": "401720138",
            "speakerId": 1094,
            "speakerName": "Ororon",
            "text": "Why?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720139"
            ]
          },
          "401720139": {
            "id": "401720139",
            "speakerId": 1096,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "It's a safety measure.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720140"
            ]
          },
          "401720140": {
            "id": "401720140",
            "speakerId": 1096,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "#You have a better understanding of the spirit domain than {NICKNAME}. If this really is a Sanhaj relic, you'll be better placed to deal with the fallout in the event that something goes wrong.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720141"
            ]
          },
          "401720141": {
            "id": "401720141",
            "speakerId": 1094,
            "speakerName": "Ororon",
            "text": "#Ah... See, Paimon? Told you Granny has a soft spot for {NICKNAME}. Look at her not wanting to put {M#him}{F#her} in danger.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720142"
            ]
          },
          "401720142": {
            "id": "401720142",
            "speakerId": 1094,
            "speakerName": "Ororon",
            "text": "Meanwhile, I'm just a grandkid, so I'm expendable.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720143"
            ]
          },
          "401720143": {
            "id": "401720143",
            "speakerId": 1096,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "Hey! What are you blabbing on about?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720144"
            ]
          },
          "401720144": {
            "id": "401720144",
            "speakerId": 1094,
            "speakerName": "Ororon",
            "text": "Sorry, Granny. I'm ready now.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720145"
            ]
          },
          "401720145": {
            "id": "401720145",
            "speakerId": 1096,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "Then let us begin.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720149"
            ]
          },
          "401720149": {
            "id": "401720149",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Alright! What's on the scroll this time... Looks like a broken bow, covered in flames...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720150"
            ]
          },
          "401720150": {
            "id": "401720150",
            "speakerId": 1094,
            "speakerName": "Ororon",
            "text": "Hey, don't you think one of the pieces looks just like this shard?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720151"
            ]
          },
          "401720151": {
            "id": "401720151",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "You're right! It seems to be from the body of the bow...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720152"
            ]
          },
          "401720152": {
            "id": "401720152",
            "speakerId": 1094,
            "speakerName": "Ororon",
            "text": "I saw a bow just like this in one of Granny's scrolls...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720153"
            ]
          },
          "401720153": {
            "id": "401720153",
            "speakerId": 1096,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "...Yes, it's the weapon Sanhaj used in the Battle of the Mare Jivari. I guess that proves it — this shard is a bona fide Sanhaj relic.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720154"
            ]
          },
          "401720154": {
            "id": "401720154",
            "speakerId": 1094,
            "speakerName": "Ororon",
            "text": "#Good old Sanhaj... The relic's spiritual energy was fluctuating very strongly, but I wasn't in any danger at all. {NICKNAME} probably would have been fine as well.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720155"
            ]
          },
          "401720155": {
            "id": "401720155",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Now that's a true hero, huh? Generations later, and the stuff he used to own is helping to treat spirit-duffers.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720156"
            ]
          },
          "401720156": {
            "id": "401720156",
            "speakerId": 1096,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "I still think there's more to this story, though. Kokuchuu must have had his own motives beyond just treating Leyla's condition.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720157"
            ]
          },
          "401720157": {
            "id": "401720157",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hmm, well... Okay, we saw the full bow just now, right? Maybe he wanted to see it too, so he could track down the other pieces?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720158"
            ]
          },
          "401720158": {
            "id": "401720158",
            "speakerId": 1094,
            "speakerName": "Ororon",
            "text": "I don't know if he'd have anything to gain by doing that. Even if they're Sanhaj relics, I still doubt he'd have much use for a broken bow.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720159"
            ]
          },
          "401720159": {
            "id": "401720159",
            "speakerId": 1096,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "Also, why use a spirit-duffer in that case? You're basically setting yourself up for failure.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720160"
            ]
          },
          "401720160": {
            "id": "401720160",
            "speakerId": 14603,
            "speakerName": "Leyla",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720161"
            ]
          },
          "401720161": {
            "id": "401720161",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Huh? Leyla's body is responding!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720162"
            ]
          },
          "401720162": {
            "id": "401720162",
            "speakerId": 1096,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "Let me take a look. I can sense a spirit being drawn to the relic...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720163"
            ]
          },
          "401720163": {
            "id": "401720163",
            "speakerId": 1094,
            "speakerName": "Ororon",
            "text": "Looks like Granny's plan is working. Leyla's spirit is being drawn to the bait.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720164"
            ]
          },
          "401720164": {
            "id": "401720164",
            "speakerId": 1096,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "In that case, let me try again — this time using both Leyla's body and the shard as mediums.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720165"
            ]
          },
          "401720165": {
            "id": "401720165",
            "speakerId": 1094,
            "speakerName": "Ororon",
            "text": "You can do it, Granny. I'm ready to go too.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720166"
            ]
          },
          "401720166": {
            "id": "401720166",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Actually, can I control the spiritloom this time?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720167"
            ]
          },
          "401720167": {
            "id": "401720167",
            "speakerId": 1096,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "You got the itch too, huh?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720168"
            ]
          },
          "401720168": {
            "id": "401720168",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Plus Ororon went last time. It's only fair to take it in turns.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720169"
            ]
          },
          "401720169": {
            "id": "401720169",
            "speakerId": 1094,
            "speakerName": "Ororon",
            "text": "Fine by me. We know it's safe now, so you shouldn't have any problems.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720170"
            ]
          },
          "401720170": {
            "id": "401720170",
            "speakerId": 1096,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "Hmm...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720171"
            ]
          },
          "401720171": {
            "id": "401720171",
            "speakerId": 1096,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "Alright, if you insist, be my guest. Just let me know when you're ready."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
