    {
      "subId": "4017203",
      "subQuestName": "Use the spiritloom to weave the scroll",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "401720301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "401720301": {
            "id": "401720301",
            "speakerId": 1094,
            "speakerName": "Ororon",
            "text": "Don't worry, I'm quite sure the shard is safe. There shouldn't be any danger."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4017204",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Citlali",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "401720401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "401720401": {
            "id": "401720401",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Another image has appeared! This one is... a map!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720402"
            ]
          },
          "401720402": {
            "id": "401720402",
            "speakerId": 1094,
            "speakerName": "Ororon",
            "text": "A map? Of where?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720403"
            ]
          },
          "401720403": {
            "id": "401720403",
            "speakerId": 1096,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "Could it be... the Mare Jivari?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720404"
            ]
          },
          "401720404": {
            "id": "401720404",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "The Mare Jivari!?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720405"
            ]
          },
          "401720405": {
            "id": "401720405",
            "speakerId": 1096,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "The Mare Jivari was reduced to a desolate wasteland after that big battle. Or rather, it became known as the Mare Jivari after what happened there.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720406"
            ]
          },
          "401720406": {
            "id": "401720406",
            "speakerId": 1096,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "The ashes of the monsters and warriors who fought there covered the entire battlefield. Sometimes, bone-chilling cries would be heard from the depths. Other times, the whole region would become engulfed in towering flames, drowning out the cries...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720407"
            ]
          },
          "401720407": {
            "id": "401720407",
            "speakerId": 1096,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "That place is full of untold dangers and mysteries. Over the centuries, the finest adventurers have tried to prove themselves by venturing in... Sadly, most ended up perishing there.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720408"
            ]
          },
          "401720408": {
            "id": "401720408",
            "speakerId": 1096,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "That lasted up until around twenty or thirty years ago, when strange things started happening. People started speaking of an enormous, dark creature the size of a mountain roaming inside the Mare Jivari...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720409"
            ]
          },
          "401720409": {
            "id": "401720409",
            "speakerId": 1096,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "And then, shortly after that, the whole region just completely disappeared. Nobody knows how, but that infamously ominous place just vanished from the face of the world.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720410"
            ]
          },
          "401720410": {
            "id": "401720410",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "What!? How the heck!?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720411"
            ]
          },
          "401720411": {
            "id": "401720411",
            "speakerId": 1096,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "I know, right? Anyway, if I'm not mistaken, the place indicated on this map is where it used to be before it disappeared.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720412"
            ]
          },
          "401720412": {
            "id": "401720412",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "And where is that?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720413"
            ]
          },
          "401720413": {
            "id": "401720413",
            "speakerId": 1096,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "At the westernmost part of Natlan. It's a very remote location, far away from any of the tribes. There never used to be a settlement there, but there's been more people since the Mare Jivari disappeared.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720414"
            ]
          },
          "401720414": {
            "id": "401720414",
            "speakerId": 1096,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "Anyway, that's just what I've heard. I've never been there myself.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720415"
            ]
          },
          "401720415": {
            "id": "401720415",
            "speakerId": 1096,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "This is what age does to you. The older you get, the less adventurous you become.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720416"
            ]
          },
          "401720416": {
            "id": "401720416",
            "speakerId": 1094,
            "speakerName": "Ororon",
            "text": "That's just an excuse. Granny's too lazy to take a trip that far away...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720417"
            ]
          },
          "401720417": {
            "id": "401720417",
            "speakerId": 1096,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "Hold on a second! There's a spirit approaching the shard and the woven scroll!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720418"
            ]
          },
          "401720418": {
            "id": "401720418",
            "speakerId": 14603,
            "speakerName": "Leyla",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720419"
            ]
          },
          "401720419": {
            "id": "401720419",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Ooh! Leyla's body is responding again!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720420"
            ]
          },
          "401720420": {
            "id": "401720420",
            "speakerId": 1096,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "Quite a strong reaction this time. Does this mean what he was really seeking was the Mare Jivari's location?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720421"
            ]
          },
          "401720421": {
            "id": "401720421",
            "speakerId": 1094,
            "speakerName": "Ororon",
            "text": "I sense it too... There's a soul nearby — almost a complete one.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720422"
            ]
          },
          "401720422": {
            "id": "401720422",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Eek! This is creeping Paimon out...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720423"
            ]
          },
          "401720423": {
            "id": "401720423",
            "speakerId": 1096,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "Seems like the plan is working.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720424"
            ]
          },
          "401720424": {
            "id": "401720424",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "So, um... can we just wake him up now?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720425"
            ]
          },
          "401720425": {
            "id": "401720425",
            "speakerId": 1096,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "Not today. You might think bringing a spirit back into its body is like pouring water from one bottle into another, but it's far more complicated than that.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720426"
            ]
          },
          "401720426": {
            "id": "401720426",
            "speakerId": 1096,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "I need to borrow a ceremonial sword, and make some other preparations. It'll take me about two days.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401720427"
            ]
          },
          "401720427": {
            "id": "401720427",
            "speakerId": 1096,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "But don't worry, now that his spirit's returned, there's just one step left. Let's meet up again in two days."
          }
        }
      }
    },
